            <description><![CDATA[<p>URL: <a href="https://www.cbsnews.com/news/facebook-liable-deceiving-users-cambridge-analytica/">https://www.cbsnews.com/news/facebook-liable-deceiving-users-cambridge-analytica/</a>, See on <a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49852302">Hacker News</a></p>
